# Recognizes the palindromes over {a, b} with two tapes.
#
# q0  copies the input to tape 2.
# q1  returns the head of tape 1 to the start while the head of tape 2 stays
#     on the last symbol of the copy.
# q2  compares tape 1 forward with tape 2 backward, stopping the machine if
#     the symbols differ.
# q3  accepts with the input preserved on tape 1.

# Q
q0 q1 q2 q3
# Σ
a b
# Γ
a b _
# q0
q0
# b
_
# F
q3
# number of tapes
2
# δ: from read1 read2 to write1 move1 write2 move2
q0 a _ q0 a R a R
q0 b _ q0 b R b R
q0 _ _ q1 _ L _ L
q1 a a q1 a L a S
q1 a b q1 a L b S
q1 b a q1 b L a S
q1 b b q1 b L b S
q1 _ a q2 _ R a S
q1 _ b q2 _ R b S
q1 _ _ q3 _ S _ S
q2 a a q2 a R a L
q2 b b q2 b R b L
q2 _ _ q3 _ S _ S
